# Title: Product search functionality is broken

# Description:
Users are reporting that they are unable to search for products on the website. When attempting to use the search bar, the application returns an error and no results are displayed. Monitoring shows an increase in 500 Internal Server Errors originating from the catalogue service's `/search` endpoint.

